WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:18.750
It was the first day of summer vacation.

2
00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:25.522
"Yay!" said Harry.

3
00:00:25.523 --> 00:00:29.118
"No more school!"

4
00:00:29.119 --> 00:00:34.739
"I'm glad school is over," said Emmy.

5
00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:38.644
"Summer is much more fun!"

6
00:00:38.645 --> 00:00:45.287
"What should we do first?" asked Harry.

7
00:00:45.288 --> 00:00:47.501
"Hmm . . . ," said Emmy.

8
00:00:47.502 --> 00:00:55.228
"I know! Let's ride our bikes to the park."

9
00:00:55.229 --> 00:01:01.206
Emmy and Harry rode to the park.

10
00:01:01.207 --> 00:01:06.372
They climbed on the monkey bars.

11
00:01:06.373 --> 00:01:18.483
They fed bread to the ducks.

12
00:01:18.484 --> 00:01:21.712
Then they rode home.

13
00:01:21.713 --> 00:01:25.420
"What should we do next?" asked Harry.

14
00:01:25.421 --> 00:01:31.037
The sun felt very hot.

15
00:01:31.038 --> 00:01:34.949
"Let's go under the sprinkler!" said Emmy.

16
00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:39.163
Emmy and Harry put on their swimsuits.

17
00:01:39.164 --> 00:01:43.303
Mom turned on the sprinkler.

18
00:01:43.304 --> 00:01:48.000
Emmy and Harry ran through the cool spray.

19
00:01:48.001 --> 00:01:52.821
"This is fun!" said Harry.

20
00:01:52.822 --> 00:01:59.198
"It's much better than school," said Emmy.

21
00:01:59.199 --> 00:02:05.106
Next Harry and Emmy played cards.

22
00:02:05.107 --> 00:02:11.564
Then they ate ice pops.

23
00:02:11.565 --> 00:02:16.621
They went roller-skating.

24
00:02:16.622 --> 00:02:28.082
They played tag and hide-and-seek.

25
00:02:28.083 --> 00:02:45.540
They played fetch with Rover.

26
00:02:45.541 --> 00:02:48.635
"Now what should we do?" asked Harry.

27
00:02:48.636 --> 00:02:54.764
Emmy shrugged. "I don't know," she said.

28
00:02:54.765 --> 00:02:58.531
Later Mom came into the family room.

29
00:02:58.532 --> 00:03:02.304
Emmy and Harry were just sitting there.

30
00:03:02.305 --> 00:03:06.309
"What's wrong?" Mom asked.

31
00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:10.733
"We're tired," moaned Harry.

32
00:03:10.734 --> 00:03:14.775
"We're bored," moaned Emmy.

33
00:03:14.776 --> 00:03:25.747
"When does school start again?"
